GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?category=就職活動

### 1. 1件登録する
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
 "title": "課題の提出物を確認する",
  "category": "プログラミング",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-01"
}

### 2. 1件取得する
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1

### 3. 1件更新する
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "企画書を完成させる",
  "detail": null,
  "category": "マーケティング",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-01",
  "completed": false
}

### 4. 1件削除する
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1

### 6. 自分のアプリの祝日API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/holidays

### 7. 期間指定でTodoを取得

GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?from=2026-10-20&to=2026-10-23
### 8. 履歴書を印刷する
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "履歴書を印刷する",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-10-27"
}

### 9. 面接の質問を準備する
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "面接の質問を準備する",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-10-27"
}

### 10. 企業情報を確認する
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "企業情報を確認する",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 3,
  "dueDate": "2026-10-27"
}

### 11. テスト用Todoを削除（履歴書）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/15

### 12. テスト用Todoを削除（面接）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/16

### 13. テスト用Todoを削除（企業情報）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/17

### 14. MCPの窓口を確かめる
 POST http://localhost:8080/mcp

### 15. 窓口と会話を始める
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": { "name": "requests.http", "version": "1.0" }
  }
}

### 16. 道具の一覧をもらう
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: 0e8e6684-85b3-489d-a6bc-cae88bb3d877

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/list", "params": {} }

### 17. 道具を1つ呼んでみる
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: b4c11631-3be8-45a6-9271-23cfd4631682

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "tools/call",
  "params": { "name": "list_todos", "arguments": {} } }